an seats at risk.\n\nThe race is expensive on both sides, with each candidate raising over $900,000 and outside groups spending heavily. A late-August poll showed the candidates statistically tied, and prediction markets currently price Garcia as the modest favorite even as most expert ratings lean Republican. The forecast treats this as a true tossup with a slight Democratic tilt.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.4325, "margin": -0.99}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.5895, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6117, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6193, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.5254, "margin": 1.0}]}